by the check program.

00:04:50.014 --> 00:04:51.314
What do you mean?

00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:53.544
Who are you guys...?

00:04:56.594 --> 00:05:00.294
Have you heard about the legend
of the Dot Hackers?

00:05:00.494 --> 00:05:01.964
Well, yeah...

00:05:02.034 --> 00:05:03.724
...they're part
of the game's story.

00:05:03.804 --> 00:05:05.394
It's not a story.

00:05:05.464 --> 00:05:06.594
They're real.

00:05:07.174 --> 00:05:10.434
Just as the power within your PC
is not part of the specs...

00:05:10.504 --> 00:05:12.994
...they originate somewhere
beyond the system.

00:05:13.174 --> 00:05:17.134
In The World, there is a factor
that doesn't exist in the specs.

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:21.944
Our duty as Raven
is to find a way to control it...

00:05:22.014 --> 00:05:25.574
